# nodes.list -- the node structs sq's parser can build, by
# PostgreSQL's names: the ones gen/gen_nodes.py writes into
# include/sq_nodes.h.
#
# It is every struct the grammar makes (makeNode in gram.y and
# parser.c, and in the makefuncs.c functions they call), the five
# value nodes, and every struct a field of one of those points at.
# Query and FuncExpr are left out: the analyzer fills the two
# fields that point at them, and the parser leaves both NULL.
